      "writtenOn": "2022-11-25T04:43:08Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I mean instead of passing the MdnsResponse here, you could still pass in the serviceInstanceName. You will get the removed MdnsResponse object as the return value of instanceNameToResponse.remove.\n\nThis would likely be more useful, because the MdnsResponse that you have as argument is a Goodbye that may not have all the info; but the MdnsResponse removed from instanceNameToResponse is the last known info, which may be more useful to provide in callbacks.\n\nThen you probably don\u0027t need to modify buildMdnsServiceInfoFromResponse here, either (maybe only later when returning PTR-only discovered services)",
      "parentUuid": "b959f831_36b01e99",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 263,
        "startChar": 44,
        "endLine": 263,
        "endChar": 56
      },
      "revId": "6ce1f61c82a258761da7fd8bbd4e9fba65809832",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
